Mantharā climbs palace and sees decked Ayōdhyā --- Mantharā questions nurse --- Nurse announces Rāma crowning on Puṣya --- Mantharā descends in anger --- Mantharā warns sleeping Kaikēyī of fleeting fortune --- Kaikēyī grows distressed and asks cause --- Mantharā calls Daśaratha deceitful and warns Bharata ruin --- Kaikēyī rewards Mantharā with ornament --- Kaikēyī welcomes Rāma crowning and offers boon
